msgctxt "400"
msgid "What took you so long, Uncle Kaz? I was getting tired of waiting..."
msgstr ""
"Perché ci hai messo così tanto, zio Kaz? Mi sono stufata di aspettare..."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "The hell took so long, Aniki? Let's get movin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Let's get going, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, can we just go home already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "C'mon, Uncle Kaz! I wanna go home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Are you... going in there, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Stai... andando lì dentro, zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "496"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Haruka was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Yeah. Sorry, but I need you to wait out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "...Okay. Have fun, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "...Ok. Divertiti, zio Kaz."

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Nah, it can wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Really? I don't mind."
msgstr "Davvero? Non mi faccio problemi."

msgctxt "556"
msgid "We, uh... goin' in, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Rikiya was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Yeah. You want to come with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'm not really in the mood. I'll be chillin' out here\r\n"
"when you're done, though. Later, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Huh? Changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "You goin' in there, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Mikio was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Naturally. Do you want to join me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Uh... Thanks, but no thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Huh? Don't go changin' your plans on account of me, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Are you going in there, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Stai... andando lì dentro, zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "712"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Ayako was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr "(Cacchio, mi ero dimenticato che Haruka era con me! E adesso!?)"

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Yeah. Think you can wait here for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "...Okay, but don't take too long!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr "No, sono a posto."

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? I don't mind, if that's what you're worried\r\n"
"about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"You're going in there, Uncle Kaz!? C'mon, we don't have\r\n"
"time for that kinda stuff right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Taichi was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Sorry, Taichi. I won't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Huh!? But Morning Glory's in trouble, Uncle Kaz! C'mon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "(He's right. Now's not the time for this.)"
msgstr ""

